  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been trying to do some research to figure out the name of a guy who started dropping portals to a crasher world around our group the other day, but I've been stymied by hundreds of errors in the log:\n\n\"2019.05.07 21:40:01 Warning    -  Cannot set field of view on this camera while VR is enabled.\"\n\nThere's like a dozen at a time with the same time stamp indicating its outputting the same error several times a second! \n\nThis is likely slowing the game down, so it's probably worth looking into either fixing it, or at least changing the error system so it can't output the same error more than once every 10 seconds or so.",
